<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Third-party notices for the TimeWitness verifier page</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { margin: 0; background: #0b0f1a; color: #eef1f6; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; }
  main { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; }
  h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem; }
  p, li { max-width: 44rem; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem 0.3rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a3142; vertical-align: top; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; background: #131a2a; border: 1px solid #2a3142; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    body { background: #ffffff; color: #111827; }
    th, td { border-bottom-color: #d8dde6; }
    pre { background: #f5f7fa; border-color: #d8dde6; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party notices for the TimeWitness verifier page</h1>

<p>The verifier page carries one WebAssembly module, built from <code>crates/verify-web</code> in the
TimeWitness repository for the <code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code> target, against the versions pinned in
its <code>Cargo.lock</code>. The crates below are compiled into that module, and each one is listed with
the licence it is used under here and the licence text it ships with, copyright lines included.</p>

<p>The page's own script is written in the page and uses no third-party JavaScript. Its styles, the
brand tokens, and the lockup are ours. TimeWitness itself is under the Apache License 2.0, in the
<code>LICENSE</code> and <code>NOTICE</code> files at the root of the repository.</p>

<h2>Crates in the module</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Crate</th><th>Version</th><th>Licence</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#each crates}}<tr><td>{{package.name}}</td><td>{{package.version}}</td><td>{{license}}</td></tr>
{{/each}}</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3>{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by {{#each used_by}}{{#if @index}}, {{/if}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/each}}.</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
